<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as primary */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; text-align: left; }
  .header-title { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .sub-header { font-size: 12pt; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>
      <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Creighton</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: normal;">UNIVERSITY</div>
      <div style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 5px;">Enrollment Management</div>
      <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Office of Financial Aid</div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="header-title">2022-23 Income Information</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 5px;">Student Nontax Filers</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">Dependent Student</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 5px;">
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">Student Name</span>
      </div>
      <div style="width: 50%;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">NET ID</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <p>Your FAFSA was selected for review in a process called verification. Please complete this form and return it along with other required documents listed in your NEST account. Documents must be signed, identified with your name and NET ID and sent via fax or uploaded using the "JayDrop" link below.</p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p><strong>Check the box that applies:</strong></p>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="box1">
      <label for="box1" style="margin-left: 5px;">I had zero income in 2020 and was not required to file a 2020 Federal Tax Return.</label>
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="box2">
      <label for="box2" style="margin-left: 5px;">I earned income in 2020, but was not required to file a 2020 Federal Tax Return. List below the names of all employers, the amount earned from each employer in 2020, and whether a W-2 is provided. Provide copies of all 2020 W-2's issued to the student by their employers. List every employer even if the employer did not issue a W-2. If more space is needed, please list additional information on the back of this worksheet.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="text-align: left; width: 33%;">Employer's Name</th>
        <th style="text-align: left; width: 33%;">2020 Amount Earned</th>
        <th style="text-align: left; width: 34%;">Attach W-2 or 1099 Form?</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in line_items %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].employer_name">{{ item.employer_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ item.amount }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="line_items[{{ loop.index0 }}].w2_attached">{{ item.w2_attached }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
      <div>
        <p><strong>Signature</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Student Signature (Required)</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Date</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 50px;">&nbsp;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 100px; font-size: 10pt; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #000; padding-top: 10px;">
    Financial Aid Office | Creighton University | 2500 California Plaza | Harper Center 1100 | Omaha, NE 68178<br>
    P: 402-280-2731 or 1-800-282-5835 | F: 402-280-2895 | E: <span data-field="financial_aid_email">{{ financial_aid_email }}</span><br>
    <a href="https://jaydrop.creighton.edu/filedrop/FinancialAid">https://jaydrop.creighton.edu/filedrop/FinancialAid</a>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 9pt; text-align: center;">
    *PLEASE NOTE: We cannot accept documentation containing personally identifiable information via email. Please use the JayDrop Link, Fax or U.S. Mail to submit this documentation.
  </div>
</div>